{
  "description": "Shared evaluation set for both architectures: the 6 public cases, the 4 remaining dataset requests, and 12 synthetic edge cases. Synthetic requests are inline and use data overrides, so no shared data file is modified. Expected values were derived by hand from data/procurement_policy.md.",
